"sdp.overview.assetMgmt.cmdb.content" : "<p>P\u00ebr nj\u00eb menaxhim efektiv t\u00eb TI-s\u00eb, \u00ebsht\u00eb e r\u00ebnd\u00ebsishme q\u00eb t\u00eb keni dukshm\u00ebri t\u00eb komponent\u00ebve t\u00eb TI-s\u00eb n\u00eb baz\u00eb t\u00eb sh\u00ebrbimeve t\u00eb biznesit. Moduli CMDB ju lejon t\u00eb organizoni t\u00eb gjith\u00eb artikujt tuaj t\u00eb konfigurimit (artikullit t\u00eb konfigurimit) si sh\u00ebrbimet, asetet dhe p\u00ebrdoruesit n\u00eb nj\u00eb vend. Mund t\u00eb p\u00ebrdorni marr\u00ebdh\u00ebnie t\u00eb paracaktuara artikullit t\u00eb konfigurimit ose t\u00eb shtoni lloje t\u00eb personalizuara t\u00eb marr\u00ebdh\u00ebnieve artikullit t\u00eb konfigurimit bazuar n\u00eb k\u00ebrkes\u00ebn tuaj. Kuptimi i var\u00ebsive midis artikullit t\u00eb konfigurimit-ve ju ndihmon t\u00eb minimizoni rreziqet me analiz\u00ebn e ndikimit t\u00eb ndryshimit dhe t\u2019i trajtoni n\u00eb m\u00ebnyr\u00eb efikase rastet e paparashikuara.</p>",
