"zia.reopenwiz.content4" : "Aplikacioni vjen me nj\u00eb grup t\u00eb dh\u00ebnash t\u00eb paracaktuar q\u00eb mund t\u00eb p\u00ebrdoret p\u00ebr t\u00eb trajnuar Zia p\u00ebr t\u00eb v\u00ebrtetuar rihapjen e k\u00ebrkes\u00ebs. P\u00ebrpara se t\u00eb aktivizoni parashikimin e Zia, rekomandohet q\u00eb ta st\u00ebrvitni Zia-n me grupin e paracaktuar t\u00eb t\u00eb dh\u00ebnave dhe ta testoni at\u00eb me mostra t\u00eb p\u00ebrgjigjeve t\u00eb p\u00ebrdoruesve, fjal\u00eb ky\u00e7e t\u00eb lidhura, fraza ose fjali t\u00eb plota. N\u00ebse parashikimi i Zia \u00ebsht\u00eb i pasakt\u00eb ose i padisponuesh\u00ebm, mund t\u00eb shtoni manualisht informacionin p\u00ebrkat\u00ebs n\u00eb grupin e t\u00eb dh\u00ebnave t\u00eb trajnimit. Zia do t\u00eb st\u00ebrvitet menj\u00ebher\u00eb me t\u00eb dh\u00ebnat e reja.",
