"sdp.overview.requestMgmt.defineYourOrganization.content" : "<p>Organizata juaj mund t\u00eb shp\u00ebrndahet n\u00eb vende t\u00eb ndryshme gjeografike dhe mund t\u00eb p\u00ebrmbaj\u00eb disa departamente. Tavolina juaj e sh\u00ebrbimit t\u00eb TI-s\u00eb mund t\u00eb jet\u00eb e centralizuar ose e shp\u00ebrndar\u00eb n\u00ebp\u00ebr vende q\u00eb punojn\u00eb n\u00eb zona t\u00eb ndryshme kohore. N\u00eb at\u00eb rast, ju mund t\u00eb konfiguroni rajonet, faqet, departamentet, or\u00ebt e pun\u00ebs, pushimet etj. n\u00eb ServiceDesk Plus. Nj\u00eb sajt tregon nj\u00eb vendndodhje fizike (deg\u00eb) t\u00eb organizat\u00ebs suaj. \u00c7do vend mund t\u00eb ket\u00eb or\u00ebt e veta t\u00eb funksionimit, pushimet dhe dit\u00ebt e pun\u00ebs.</p>",
