"sdp.overview.changeMgmt.templatesFormCustom.content" : "<p>Ashtu si shabllonet e incidenteve, mund t\u00eb konfigurosh gjithashtu shabllonet e ndryshimeve p\u00ebr t\u00eb leht\u00ebsuar ngritjen e llojeve t\u00eb ndryshme t\u00eb ndryshimeve. \u00c7do shabllon mund t\u00eb ket\u00eb fushat e veta t\u00eb p\u00ebrshtatura dhe strukturat e formular\u00ebve. \u00c7do shabllon ndryshimesh mund t\u00eb ket\u00eb fusha t\u00eb parazgjedhura si kategoria, p\u00ebrpar\u00ebsia, lloji i ndryshimit, ndikimi, urgjenca, rreziku, statusi dhe fushat e p\u00ebrshtatura. Fushat mund t\u00eb sh\u00ebnohen si t\u00eb detyrueshme. \u00c7do shabllon ndryshimesh mund t\u00eb lidhet me nj\u00eb rrjedh\u00eb pune ndryshimesh. Mund ta sh\u00ebnosh nj\u00eb shabllon ndryshimesh si urgjenc\u00eb p\u00ebr ta lidhur automatikisht me t\u00eb nj\u00eb rrjedh\u00eb pune ndryshimesh t\u00eb urgjenc\u00ebs.</p>",
