"sdp.overview.serviceCatalog.defineServices.content" : "<p>Ju mund t\u00eb krijoni kategori sh\u00ebrbimesh p\u00ebr t\u00eb p\u00ebrcaktuar sh\u00ebrbimet e nivelit t\u00eb lart\u00eb q\u00eb u ofrohen p\u00ebrdoruesve. K\u00ebto mund t\u00eb jen\u00eb nj\u00eb kombinim i Sh\u00ebrbimeve t\u00eb Biznesit (p.sh. sh\u00ebrbimet e faqes n\u00eb internet) dhe Sh\u00ebrbimeve IT (sh\u00ebrbimet e Active Directory). Ju mund t\u00eb p\u00ebrfshini parametra t\u00eb ndrysh\u00ebm q\u00eb lidhen me sh\u00ebrbimin si, objektivi i disponueshm\u00ebris\u00eb p\u00ebr sh\u00ebrbimin, ndikimi i biznesit, or\u00ebt e mb\u00ebshtetjes s\u00eb sh\u00ebrbimit, kostoja p\u00ebr ofrimin e sh\u00ebrbimit, etj. Dokumentet p\u00ebrkat\u00ebse mund t\u2019i bashk\u00ebngjiten \u00e7do kategorie sh\u00ebrbimi. N\u00ebn \u00e7do kategori sh\u00ebrbimi, mund t\u00eb krijosh shabllone p\u00ebr sh\u00ebrbime specifike q\u00eb ofron si artikuj sh\u00ebrbimi.</p>",
