"sdp.overview.projectMgmt.milestoneTasks.content" : "<p>Nj\u00eb projekt mund t\u00eb ndahet n\u00eb faza t\u00eb shumta logjike t\u00eb quajtura etapat e r\u00ebnd\u00ebsishme. \u00c7do etap\u00eb e r\u00ebnd\u00ebsishme mund t\u00eb ndahet n\u00eb detyra dhe t\u2019u caktohet teknik\u00ebve t\u00eb ndrysh\u00ebm. Mund t\u00eb sigurohesh p\u00ebr ekzekutimin e duhur t\u00eb t\u00eb gjitha k\u00ebtyre detyrave duke konfiguruar var\u00ebsit\u00eb e detyrave. Ju gjithashtu mund t\u00eb regjistroni koh\u00ebn e shpenzuar p\u00ebr secil\u00ebn detyr\u00eb p\u00ebr t\u00eb kuptuar p\u00ebrpjekjet e p\u00ebrgjithshme t\u00eb b\u00ebra p\u00ebr projektin kundrejt p\u00ebrpjekjeve t\u00eb vler\u00ebsuara.</p>",
