"sdp.dc.dcmenus.patch.management" : "Menaxhimi i arnimeve",
"sdp.overview.integrations.customScript.content" : "<p>Ju mund t\u00eb aktivizoni ekzekutimin e skripteve t\u00eb personalizuara si Python, VBScript dhe Shell Scripts kur krijohet ose modifikohet nj\u00eb k\u00ebrkes\u00eb. K\u00ebto skripta mund t\u00eb ekzekutohen manualisht ose t\u00eb aktivizohen automatikisht n\u00eb baz\u00eb t\u00eb ve\u00e7orive t\u00eb bilet\u00ebs si kategoria, p\u00ebrpar\u00ebsia, niveli, modaliteti, departamenti, k\u00ebrkuesi etj. P\u00ebr shembull, nj\u00eb k\u00ebrkes\u00eb n\u00eb hyrje t\u00eb punonj\u00ebsit mund t\u00eb k\u00ebrkoj\u00eb fusha shtes\u00eb dhe veprime t\u00eb personalizuara q\u00eb mund t\u00eb ken\u00eb nevoj\u00eb t\u00eb aktivizohen lart duke shkruar. Ju gjithashtu mund t\u00eb p\u00ebrfshini JavaScript t\u00eb personalizuar n\u00eb an\u00ebn e klientit p\u00ebr t\u00eb manipuluar rrjedh\u00ebn e pun\u00ebs s\u00eb UI-s\u00eb s\u00eb formularit sipas k\u00ebrkesave tuaja t\u00eb procesit.</p>",
