"brsite.info" : "Rregullat e biznesit nuk bazohen m\u00eb n\u00eb sajte. T\u00eb gjitha lidhjet e m\u00ebparshme t\u00eb sajteve tani renditen n\u00ebn <b>Asociuar</b> <b>Sajtet</b> n\u00eb Grupet e Rregullave. P\u00ebr t\u00eb shtuar rregulla t\u00eb reja specifike p\u00ebr sajtin, p\u00ebrdorni <b>Site</b> fush\u00eb sipas kritereve t\u00eb rregullave.<br/><br/><b>Sajti</b> fusha ndihmon n\u00eb reduktimin e tepric\u00ebs s\u00eb rregullave n\u00ebp\u00ebr sajte. Tani mund t\u00eb krijoni rregulla q\u00eb mund t\u00eb aplikohen n\u00eb shum\u00eb site duke p\u00ebrdorur <b>Sajti</b> n\u00ebnfusha, t\u00eb tilla si <b>Emri</b>, <b>Shteti</b>, dhe <b>Rajoni</b>.<br/>P\u00ebr shembull, mund t\u00eb p\u00ebrdorni <b>rajonin</b> n\u00ebnfusha n\u00eb kriteret e rregullave p\u00ebr t\u00eb konfiguruar rregullat q\u00eb zbatohen p\u00ebr t\u00eb gjitha sajtet n\u00eb at\u00eb rajon.",
