"sdp.overview.serviceCatalog.resources.content" : "<p>P\u00ebr secilin sh\u00ebrbim t\u00eb ofruar, ju mund t\u00eb mbledhni detaje t\u00eb burimeve p\u00ebr t\u00eb siguruar mbledhjen e sakt\u00eb dhe holl\u00ebsi m\u00eb t\u00eb madhe t\u00eb informacionit nga p\u00ebrdoruesit fundor\u00eb. Nj\u00eb burim mund t\u00eb jet\u00eb nj\u00eb burim fizik (laptop, desktop, celular) ose nj\u00eb softuer apo leje qasjeje n\u00eb nj\u00eb softuer (hyrja n\u00eb aplikacionin CRM). Seksioni i burimeve n\u00eb shabllonin e katalogut t\u00eb sh\u00ebrbimeve mund t\u00eb p\u00ebrdoret p\u00ebr t\u00eb mbledhur k\u00ebt\u00eb informacion. Ju mund t\u00eb strukturoni mbledhjen e informacionit duke i b\u00ebr\u00eb p\u00ebrdoruesit nj\u00eb s\u00ebr\u00eb pyetjesh. Pyetje t\u00eb shumta mund t\u00eb grumbullohen n\u00ebn nj\u00eb burim dhe seksioni i burimeve t\u00eb shabllonit mund t\u00eb ket\u00eb disa burime.</p>",
