"sdp.admin.leftpanel.helpdesk.requestcustomfields" : "K\u00ebrkes\u00eb \u2013 Fusha shtes\u00eb",
"sdp.overview.changeMgmt.fullContent" : "Me ndryshimin e sh\u00ebrbimeve t\u00eb biznesit, ndryshojn\u00eb edhe sh\u00ebrbimet e TI-s\u00eb dhe komponent\u00ebt themelor\u00eb n\u00eb infrastruktur\u00ebn e TI-s\u00eb. \u00cbsht\u00eb e r\u00ebnd\u00ebsishme q\u00eb t\u00eb planifikoni, zbatoni dhe menaxhoni Ndryshimet tuaja t\u00eb TI-s\u00eb n\u00eb m\u00ebnyr\u00eb efektive p\u00ebr t\u00eb minimizuar ndikimin n\u00eb biznesin tuaj. Moduli Change n\u00eb ServiceDesk Plus ju ndihmon t\u00eb thjeshtoni procesin e menaxhimit t\u00eb Ndryshimit t\u00eb IT duke shmangur ndryshimet e paautorizuara dhe t\u00eb d\u00ebshtuara dhe duke minimizuar nd\u00ebrprerjet e sh\u00ebrbimit.",
