"sdp.overview.requestMgmt.technicianPortal.content" : "<p>Teknik\u00ebt mund t\u00eb hyjn\u00eb n\u00eb portalin e bazuar n\u00eb ueb p\u00ebr t\u00eb menaxhuar k\u00ebrkesat q\u00eb u jan\u00eb caktuar. Pamja e list\u00ebs s\u00eb k\u00ebrkesave paraqet pamjen e t\u00eb gjitha k\u00ebrkesave. Pamja e list\u00ebs mund t\u00eb personalizohet sipas nevojave individuale t\u00eb teknikut. Duke klikuar mbi nj\u00eb k\u00ebrkes\u00eb hapet pamja Detajet e k\u00ebrkes\u00ebs e cila tregon detajet e plota t\u00eb k\u00ebrkes\u00ebs. Tekniku mund t\u00eb shtoj\u00eb sh\u00ebnime p\u00ebr t\u00eb regjistruar veprimet e nd\u00ebrmarra dhe t\u00eb shtoj\u00eb regjistra t\u00eb koh\u00ebs s\u00eb pun\u00ebs p\u00ebr t\u00eb kapur p\u00ebrpjekjen. K\u00ebrkesat e lidhura mund t\u00eb lidhen dhe operacionet e zakonshme si shtimi i sh\u00ebnimeve, regjistrave t\u00eb pun\u00ebs, zgjidhja e k\u00ebrkesave t\u00eb lidhura mund t\u00eb b\u00ebhen s\u00eb bashku. Tekniku gjithashtu mund t\u00eb menaxhoj\u00eb detyrat ose n\u00ebn-aktivitetet e nj\u00eb k\u00ebrkese. P\u00ebr nj\u00eb k\u00ebrkes\u00eb mund t\u00eb krijohen detyra t\u00eb shumta dhe n\u00ebse \u00ebsht\u00eb e nevojshme, \u00e7do detyr\u00eb mund t\u2019i caktohet nj\u00eb tekniku t\u00eb ndrysh\u00ebm. Var\u00ebsia midis detyrave mund t\u00eb konfigurohet. Pas dh\u00ebnies s\u00eb zgjidhjes, tekniku mund t\u00eb mbyll\u00eb k\u00ebrkes\u00ebn. Ju mund t\u00eb konfiguroni rregullat e mbylljes s\u00eb k\u00ebrkes\u00ebs dhe detyrave q\u00eb sh\u00ebnojn\u00eb fusha t\u00eb caktuara q\u00eb t\u00eb plot\u00ebsohen detyrimisht p\u00ebrpara mbylljes s\u00eb k\u00ebrkes\u00ebs. Gjat\u00eb gjith\u00eb ciklit jet\u00ebsor t\u00eb k\u00ebrkes\u00ebs, k\u00ebrkesa kalon n\u00ebp\u00ebr statuse t\u00eb ndryshme. P\u00ebr \u00e7do status, mund t\u00eb konfigurosh koh\u00ebmat\u00ebsin e Marr\u00ebveshjes p\u00ebr nivelin e sh\u00ebrbimit q\u00eb t\u00eb funksionoj\u00eb ose mund ta vendos\u00ebsh koh\u00ebmat\u00ebsin n\u00eb pritje nd\u00ebrsa pret p\u00ebrgjigje nga p\u00ebrdoruesi p\u00ebrfundimtar p\u00ebr nj\u00eb pyetje.</p>",
