"booking.create.loan" : "Kredi",
"sdp.overview.serviceCatalog.workflow.content" : "<p>Kur p\u00ebrdoruesit t\u00eb hyjn\u00eb, do t\u00eb shfaqen shabllonet e Sh\u00ebrbimeve t\u00eb lejuara vet\u00ebm p\u00ebr p\u00ebrdoruesin dhe p\u00ebrdoruesi mund t\u00eb zgjedh\u00eb dhe t\u00eb plot\u00ebsoj\u00eb informacionin p\u00ebrkat\u00ebs p\u00ebr shabllonin. Detyrat e p\u00ebrfshira p\u00ebr shabllonin do t\u00eb shtohen p\u00ebr K\u00ebrkes\u00ebn e Sh\u00ebrbimit. Njoftimi q\u00eb k\u00ebrkon miratim do t\u2019i d\u00ebrgohet automatikisht autoritetit miratues. Koh\u00ebmat\u00ebsi i Marr\u00ebveshjes p\u00ebr nivelin e sh\u00ebrbimit p\u00ebr k\u00ebrkes\u00ebn do t\u00eb ndalet derisa t\u00eb p\u00ebrfundoj\u00eb veprimi i miratimit t\u00eb k\u00ebrkes\u00ebs. Pasi k\u00ebrkesa t\u00eb miratohet, detyrat do t\u00eb aktivizohen automatikisht n\u00eb m\u00ebnyr\u00eb q\u00eb tekniku i detyrave t\u00eb filloj\u00eb t\u00eb p\u00ebrmbush\u00eb k\u00ebrkes\u00ebn. Njoftimet me email mund t\u00eb konfigurohen p\u00ebr t\u00eb k\u00ebrkuar teknikun, teknikun e detyrave, p\u00ebrdoruesin fundor n\u00eb m\u00ebnyr\u00eb q\u00eb t\u2019i mbajn\u00eb ata t\u00eb informuar p\u00ebr statusin e k\u00ebrkes\u00ebs. Detyra t\u00eb ndryshme mund t\u2019u caktohen teknik\u00ebve t\u00eb ndrysh\u00ebm. Detyrat e varura do t\u00eb aktivizohen bazuar n\u00eb sh\u00ebnimin e var\u00ebsis\u00eb s\u00eb detyr\u00ebs. K\u00ebrkesa mund t\u00eb mbyllet pasi t\u00eb keni p\u00ebrfunduar t\u00eb gjitha detyrat e lidhura.</p>",
