"sdp.overview.serviceCatalog.automation.content" : "<p>Ngjash\u00ebm me rregullat e biznesit n\u00eb Menaxhimin e Incidentit, rregullat e biznesit t\u00eb katalogut t\u00eb sh\u00ebrbimeve ndihmojn\u00eb n\u00eb automatizimin e rrug\u00ebzimit t\u00eb k\u00ebrkesave t\u00eb sh\u00ebrbimit p\u00ebr grupin ose teknikun p\u00ebrkat\u00ebs, bazuar n\u00eb kritere. P\u00ebrve\u00e7 grupit dhe teknikut, p\u00ebrmes rregullave t\u00eb biznesit mund t\u00eb vendosen edhe parametra t\u00eb tjer\u00eb si kategoria, prioriteti etj. Rregullat e biznesit mund t\u00eb konfigurohen q\u00eb t\u00eb aktivizohen gjat\u00eb ose jasht\u00eb orarit t\u00eb pun\u00ebs.</p>",
