"sdp.overview.changeMgmt.chngSLA.content" : "<p>Marr\u00ebveshjet e nivelit t\u00eb sh\u00ebrbimit ju ndihmojn\u00eb t\u00eb p\u00ebrcaktoni koh\u00ebn brenda s\u00eb cil\u00ebs duhet t\u00eb zgjidhet nj\u00eb K\u00ebrkes\u00eb Ndryshimi. Marr\u00ebveshjet p\u00ebr nivelin e sh\u00ebrbimit aplikohen automatikisht gjat\u00eb K\u00ebrkesave t\u00eb Ndryshimit \u201eShto/P\u00ebrdit\u00ebso\u201c bazuar n\u00eb disa kritere t\u00eb cilat mund t\u2019i p\u00ebrcaktosh. Marr\u00ebveshja p\u00ebr nivelin e sh\u00ebrbimit mund t\u00eb konfigurohet q\u00eb t\u00eb aplikohet n\u00eb or\u00ebt operative dhe jo funksionale. Dhe mund t\u00eb konfiguroj\u00eb P\u00ebrshkall\u00ebzime t\u00eb Marr\u00ebveshjes p\u00ebr nivelin e sh\u00ebrbimit p\u00ebr t\u00eb menaxhuar p\u00ebrfundimin e Marr\u00ebveshjes p\u00ebr nivelin e sh\u00ebrbimit n\u00eb koh\u00eb.</p>",
