"sdp.overview.requestMgmt.emailProcessing.content" : "<p>ServiceDesk Plus mund t\u00eb konfigurohet p\u00ebr t\u2019i konvertuar automatikisht emailet n\u00eb bileta t\u00eb ndihm\u00ebs teknike. Mund t\u00eb p\u00ebrdorni cil\u00ebsimet e serverit t\u00eb post\u00ebs hyr\u00ebse p\u00ebr t\u00eb konfiguruar llogarin\u00eb e post\u00ebs nga e cila do t\u00eb merren e-mailet dhe do t\u00eb shnd\u00ebrrohen n\u00eb k\u00ebrkesa. Ekipi juaj i IT-s\u00eb mund t\u00eb konfiguroj\u00eb cil\u00ebsimet e serverit t\u00eb post\u00ebs dal\u00ebse p\u00ebr t\u00eb d\u00ebrguar e-mail tek p\u00ebrdoruesit fundor\u00eb ose k\u00ebrkuesit. \u00c7do e-mail nga nj\u00eb k\u00ebrkues q\u00eb ka t\u00eb b\u00ebj\u00eb me nj\u00eb k\u00ebrkes\u00eb ekzistuese do t\u00eb shtohet si nj\u00eb bised\u00eb n\u00eb k\u00ebrkes\u00eb. Filtri i post\u00ebs s\u00eb pad\u00ebshiruar mund t\u00eb konfigurohet p\u00ebr t\u00eb bllokuar konvertimin e emaileve specifike n\u00eb bileta.</p>",
"sdp.security.bannermsg.disable.dynamic.useraddition" : "\u00c7aktivizo shtimin dinamik t\u00eb p\u00ebrdoruesve q\u00eb nuk jan\u00eb n\u00eb aplikacion.",
