"sdp.inventory.associatetocomp.message" : "Lidhja e komponent\u00ebve n\u00eb k\u00ebt\u00eb aset mund t\u00eb b\u00ebhet k\u00ebtu. Ju lutemi shtoni komponent\u00eb n\u00ebse nuk ka p\u00ebrb\u00ebr\u00ebs t\u00eb disponuesh\u00ebm n\u00eb \u201eLista e Komponent\u00ebve\u201c. Lista \u201eP\u00ebrb\u00ebr\u00ebsit e bashkangjitur\u201c tregon komponent\u00ebt e bashkangjitur aktualisht me k\u00ebt\u00eb burim.",
