"project.cost.settings.info" : "Parametrat e kostos t\u00eb lejojn\u00eb t\u00eb konfigurosh nj\u00eb opsion p\u00ebr t\u00eb llogaritur vler\u00ebn e fush\u00ebs s\u00eb <strong>Kostos Aktuale</strong> t\u00eb projektit duke p\u00ebrdorur vlera nga entitetet e nivelit t\u00eb posht\u00ebm.",
"sdp.admin.workflow.stage.mandatorystatus" : "{0} Statusi \u00ebsht\u00eb i detyruesh\u00ebm p\u00ebr faz\u00ebn {1}.",
"sdp.overview.integrations.opm.content" : "<p>ManageEngine OpManager (OPM) \u00ebsht\u00eb nj\u00eb softuer monitorues i server\u00ebve dhe rrjeteve i p\u00ebrdorur nga nd\u00ebrmarrjet p\u00ebr t\u00eb menaxhuar qendrat e tyre t\u00eb t\u00eb dh\u00ebnave dhe infrastruktur\u00ebn e TI-s\u00eb n\u00eb m\u00ebnyr\u00eb efikase. Duke integruar OpManager me ServiceDesk Plus, ju mund t\u00eb zbuloni gabimet dhe problemet e performanc\u00ebs n\u00eb rrjetin tuaj dhe t\u00eb merrni njoftime t\u00eb menj\u00ebhershme. Ju gjithashtu mund t\u00eb aktivizoni krijimin automatik t\u00eb biletave n\u00eb tavolin\u00ebn e ndihm\u00ebs s\u00eb IT n\u00eb rast t\u00eb d\u00ebshtimeve t\u00eb rrjetit. T\u00eb gjitha detajet e stacionit t\u00eb pun\u00ebs dhe serverit s\u00eb bashku me konfigurimet e marr\u00ebdh\u00ebnieve mund t\u00eb shikohen drejtp\u00ebrdrejt nga aplikacioni OpManager kur \u00ebsht\u00eb e nevojshme. Nga faqja e detajeve t\u00eb pajisjes OPM, mund t\u00eb thirrni detajet e stacionit t\u00eb pun\u00ebs ose t\u00eb serverit t\u00eb skanuar dhe t\u00eb shikoni marr\u00ebdh\u00ebniet e konfiguruara n\u00eb ServiceDesk Plus p\u00ebr nj\u00eb pajisje t\u00eb caktuar.</p>",
