"sdp.overview.serviceCatalog.serviceLvlAgmt.content" : "<p>Marr\u00ebveshjet p\u00ebr nivelin e sh\u00ebrbimit (SLA) mund t\u00eb p\u00ebrcaktohen p\u00ebr sh\u00ebrbimet e ofruara nga ekipi i Ndihm\u00ebs Teknike t\u00eb TI-s\u00eb p\u00ebr p\u00ebrdoruesit e tyre fundor\u00eb. Marr\u00ebveshjet p\u00ebr nivelin e sh\u00ebrbimit mund t\u00eb konfigurohen dhe t\u00eb lidhen me \u00e7do shabllon sh\u00ebrbimi paraprakisht. K\u00ebto Marr\u00ebveshje p\u00ebr nivelin e sh\u00ebrbimit sigurojn\u00eb q\u00eb sh\u00ebrbimi i k\u00ebrkuar t\u00eb ofrohet brenda koh\u00ebs s\u00eb r\u00ebn\u00eb dakord. Nj\u00eb Marr\u00ebveshje e ndryshme p\u00ebr nivelin e sh\u00ebrbimit mund t\u00eb konfigurohet p\u00ebr lloje t\u00eb ndryshme sh\u00ebrbimesh dhe p\u00ebrshkall\u00ebzimet mund t\u00eb konfigurohen n\u00ebse sh\u00ebrbimi nuk p\u00ebrfundon brenda koh\u00ebs s\u00eb p\u00ebrcaktuar.</p>",
