"sdp.overview.requestMgmt.userSurvey.content" : "<p>Moduli i sondazhit ju ndihmon t\u00eb vler\u00ebsoni k\u00ebnaq\u00ebsin\u00eb e p\u00ebrdoruesit fundor me tavolin\u00ebn e ndihm\u00ebs s\u00eb IT duke d\u00ebrguar anketa t\u00eb personalizuara me email. Ju mund t\u00eb konfiguroni pyetjet dhe nivelet e k\u00ebnaq\u00ebsis\u00eb q\u00eb mbulojn\u00eb fusha specifike t\u00eb performanc\u00ebs s\u00eb tavolin\u00ebs s\u00eb ndihm\u00ebs. Ju mund t\u00eb planifikoni sondazhe pas p\u00ebrfundimit t\u00eb \u00e7do k\u00ebrkese ose pasi nj\u00eb num\u00ebr i caktuar k\u00ebrkesash jan\u00eb mbyllur. Raportet e anket\u00ebs ju ndihmojn\u00eb t\u00eb monitoroni performanc\u00ebn e stafit mb\u00ebshtet\u00ebs dhe tendencat e k\u00ebnaq\u00ebsis\u00eb. Ju gjithashtu mund t\u00eb p\u00ebrktheni pyet\u00ebsorin e sondazhit dhe ta shp\u00ebrndani at\u00eb p\u00ebr p\u00ebrdoruesit p\u00ebrfundimtar\u00eb n\u00eb gjeografi t\u00eb ndryshme n\u00eb shum\u00eb gjuh\u00eb.</p>",
