"associated.request.by" : "K\u00ebrkesat nga {0} - {1}",
"sdp.overview.assetMgmt.assetScan.content" : "<p>P\u00ebr t\u00eb menaxhuar n\u00eb m\u00ebnyr\u00eb efektive asetet tuaja t\u00eb TI-s\u00eb, s\u00eb pari ju duhet t\u00eb dini gjith\u00e7ka p\u00ebr asetet e harduerit dhe softuerit t\u00eb pranish\u00ebm n\u00eb organizat\u00eb. Me ServiceDesk Plus, ju mund t\u00eb skanoni t\u00eb gjitha asetet tuaja t\u00eb harduerit IT duke krijuar nj\u00eb agjent dhe duke e vendosur at\u00eb n\u00eb t\u00eb gjitha stacionet e pun\u00ebs t\u00eb Windows p\u00ebrmes politik\u00ebs s\u00eb grupit t\u00eb Active Directory. Skanimi ju merr informacionin e plot\u00eb t\u00eb harduerit dhe softuerit t\u00eb stacioneve t\u00eb pun\u00ebs. Ju gjithashtu mund t\u00eb skanoni stacione pune jo-windows si sistemet operative Linux, MAC, Solaris dhe AIX. ServiceDesk Plus ju ndihmon gjithashtu t\u00eb skanoni hostet virtual\u00eb dhe t\u00eb kapni marr\u00ebdh\u00ebniet e hostit t\u00eb VM (Makina virtuale).</p>",
