"sdp.overview.serviceCatalog.templatesFormCustom.content" : "<p>P\u00ebr \u00e7do sh\u00ebrbim q\u00eb ofron, mund t\u00eb krijosh shabllonin t\u00ebnd t\u00eb p\u00ebrshtatur me fusha t\u00eb parazgjedhura dhe t\u00eb p\u00ebrshtatura. Fushat mund t\u00eb sh\u00ebnohen si t\u00eb detyrueshme dhe faqosja e formularit mund t\u00eb rirenditet duke p\u00ebrdorur nj\u00eb funksion t\u00eb t\u00ebrheqjes dhe l\u00ebshimit. Ju mund t\u00eb ofroni nj\u00eb p\u00ebrvoj\u00eb t\u00eb personalizuar p\u00ebr p\u00ebrdoruesit fundor\u00eb n\u00eb portalin e vet\u00eb-sh\u00ebrbimit duke paraqitur vet\u00ebm ato sh\u00ebrbime q\u00eb kan\u00eb t\u00eb drejt\u00eb p\u00ebrdoruesit p\u00ebrfundimtar\u00eb ose ato q\u00eb jan\u00eb t\u00eb r\u00ebnd\u00ebsishme p\u00ebr rolin e tyre. P\u00ebr \u00e7do shabllon, mund t\u00eb caktosh gjithashtu Marr\u00ebveshjet p\u00ebr nivelin e sh\u00ebrbimit, t\u00eb konfigurosh rrjedhat e pun\u00ebs, t\u00eb p\u00ebrcaktosh proceset e miratimit me shum\u00eb faza dhe t\u00eb vendos\u00ebsh var\u00ebsi t\u00eb detyrave.</p>",
